# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build/
/coverage/

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# Python training tools (tools/README.md explains setup)
tools/.venv/
tools/__pycache__/
tools/*.pyc

# v1.1 training data: downloaded public datasets and the landmark CSVs
# extracted from them (hundreds of MB, all reproducible from
# tools/extract_landmarks.py — see tools/DATA_LICENSES.md for the sources).
# tools/reports/ is deliberately NOT ignored: the confusion matrices and
# metrics.json are the evidence behind the numbers in V2_PROGRESS.md.
tools/data/

# Internal planning / handover / progress documents — working notes only,
# not part of the released source.
/PLAN.md
/PLAN_V2_RECOGNITION.md
/V2_PROGRESS.md
.claude/
